{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/sea-la-vie-nine-yards-yas-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":557,"crm_id":"214","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Sea La Vie","slug":"sea-la-vie-nine-yards-yas-island","display_address":"Yas Island","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Nine Yards","price":3300000,"display_price":"3.3M","lattitude":24.4578624,"longitude":54.5947045,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Sea La Vie is an elegant and luxurious development by developer Nine Yards, located on Yas Island on the Persian Gulf. This unique development offers upscale accommodation with unrivalled levels of comfort and attractive views of the surrounding marine beauty.</p><p>The development offers a wide range of luxurious and spacious <strong>1-3 bedroom apartments</strong>. Functional layouts provide a comfortable living and recreational environment.</p><p>Residents are provided with world-class amenities and services:</p><p>- swimming pool with terrace</p><p>- gym</p><p>- children's playground and sports area</p><p>- spa and sauna</p><p>- green area with recreation and yoga areas, as well as barbecue facilities.</p><p>The complex is located at the southern end of Yas Island along the seafront. From here, the famous theme parks Ferrari World and Warner Bros. World and the Yas Waterworld Abu Dhabi water park can be reached in 10 minutes.</p><p>Sea La Vie has an amazing triangular shape. The interior of the apartments is inspired by nature and the sea, and the panoramic windows of the residences offer mesmerising views of the Persian Gulf and the endless horizon.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/214/images/2023/09/12/euKUjswzqKrI